{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"for u in 'https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/' 'https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/' 'https://www.prodigi.com/download/product-import-csv/' 'https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0'; do echo \\\"\"'$u\"; curl -L --max-time 20 -sS -o /tmp/prodigi-page -w '\"'%{http_code} %{content_type}\\\\n' \\\"\"'$u\"; head -c 240 /tmp/prodigi-page | tr '\"'\\\\n' ' '; echo; done\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"for u in 'https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/' 'https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/' 'https://www.prodigi.com/download/product-import-csv/' 'https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0'; do echo \\\"\"'$u\"; curl -L --max-time 20 -sS -o /tmp/prodigi-page -w '\"'%{http_code} %{content_type}\\\\n' \\\"\"'$u\"; head -c 240 /tmp/prodigi-page | tr '\"'\\\\n' ' '; echo; done\"","aggregated_output":"200 text/html\n<!doctype html> <html lang=\"en\"> <head> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta http-equiv=\"x-ua-compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\"> <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no\"> <title>Prodigi Print API documentati\nhttps://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/\n200 text/html\n <!doctype html> <html lang=\"en\">   <head>     <meta charset=\"utf-8\">     <meta content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\" http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\">     <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1\">     <title>Pr\nhttps://www.prodigi.com/download/product-import-csv/\n404 text/html\n<!doctype html> <html lang=\"en\"> <head> <meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta http-equiv=\"x-ua-compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\"> <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no\"> <title>Page not found | Prodigi</tit\nhttps://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0\n404 \n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"curl -L -sS 'https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/' -o /tmp/prodigi-reference.html\nrg -n -i 'sandbox|Orders|assets|sku|GLOBAL-TEE|printArea|shippingMethod|recipient|products' /tmp/prodigi-reference.html | head -200\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"curl -L -sS 'https://www.prodigi.com/print-api/docs/reference/' -o /tmp/prodigi-reference.html\nrg -n -i 'sandbox|Orders|assets|sku|GLOBAL-TEE|printArea|shippingMethod|recipient|products' /tmp/prodigi-reference.html | head -200\"","aggregated_output":"9:    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"A print API for dropshipped custom products. Current version is v4.\">\n332:<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A print API for dropshipped custom products. Current version is v4.\" />\n367:                    <a href=\"#environments-sandbox\" class=\"toc-h2 toc-link\" data-title=\"Sandbox\">Sandbox</a>\n378:            <a href=\"#orders\" class=\"toc-h1 toc-link\" data-title=\"Orders\">Orders</a>\n390:                    <a href=\"#get-orders\" class=\"toc-h2 toc-link\" data-title=\"Get orders\">Get orders</a>\n410:                    <a href=\"#update-recipient\" class=\"toc-h2 toc-link\" data-title=\"Update recipient\">Update recipient</a>\n490:                    <a href=\"#the-order-process-2-assets-download\" class=\"toc-h2 toc-link\" data-title=\"2. Assets download\">2. Assets download</a>\n559:<p>We have two environments: <strong>Sandbox</strong> and <strong>Live</strong>. Creating a new account on the <a href=\"https://dashboard.prodigi.com/\" title=\"Live production dashboard\">Live Dashboard</a> will automatically set up both a Sandbox and Live account.</p>\n560:<h2 id='environments-sandbox'>Sandbox</h2>\n561:<p>Sandbox is our <strong>testing</strong> environment. It <strong>will not fulfil your orders</strong>, and you will <strong>not be charged</strong> for using it.</p>\n564:<li>Sandbox API: <strong>api.sandbox.prodigi.com</strong></li>\n565:<li>Sandbox dashboard: <a href=\"https://sandbox-beta-dashboard.pwinty.com/\" title=\"Sandbox dashboard\">sandbox-beta-dashboard.pwinty.com</a></li>\n568:<p>Live is our <strong>production</strong> environment. Any orders that are placed here <strong>will be produced and shipped</strong>.</p>\n578:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.prodigi.com/v4.0/Orders\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n587:Your API credentials may differ between Sandbox and Live. If you have issues authenticating, please ensure you are using the correct credentials for that environment.\n592:                <h1 id='orders'>Orders</h1>\n602:    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"shippingMethod\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Overnight\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n608:            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"downloadAssets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"NotStarted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n609:            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printReadyAssetsPrepared\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"NotStarted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n617:    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipient\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n645:            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sku\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"GLOBAL-CFPM-16X20\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n647:            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n651:            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"assets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">\n654:                    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"default\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n661:            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipientCost\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n712:<td><code>shippingMethod</code></td>\n742:<td><code>recipient</code></td>\n743:<td><a href=\"#order-object-recipient\" title=\"Order recipient\">Recipient</a></td>\n757:<td>Items to be fulfilled (products + assets).</td>\n772:<h3 id='order-object-recipient'>Recipient</h3>\n785:<td>Recipient&#39;s name. Very long name strings may be truncated to suit courier guidelines.</td>\n791:<td>Recipient&#39;s email address</td>\n797:<td>Recipient&#39;s mobile phone number</td>\n803:<td>Recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n808:While recipient <code>email</code> and <code>phoneNumber</code> are technically optional, it's highly recommended you include these if you have international orders as they aid couriers with customs issues.\n824:<td>First line of recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n830:<td>Second line of recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n836:<td>Postcode or zip code of recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n842:<td>Two-letter <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_ISO_3166_country_codes\" title=\"ISO country code list\">ISO country code</a> of recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n848:<td>Town or city of recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n854:<td>State or county for the recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n858:<p>The <code>branding</code> object allows you to specify one or more branded assets (e.g. postcards, flyers, stickers, and packing slips) that will be included in the shipment. Each item must be supplied as a URL pointing to a publicly accessible asset.</p>\n932:<td>A publicly accessible URL pointing to print-ready assets. Each asset will be validated for format and quality.</td>\n1164:<td>A status indicator for the item expected values are: <code>Ok</code> nothing wrong with this item, <code>Invalid</code> one or more assets have failed to download and <code>NotYetDownloaded</code> the assets associated with this item are yet to be downloaded.</td>\n1173:<td><code>sku</code></td>\n1176:<td>The Prodigi SKU of the product. Use the lookups endpoints to find out more information on each SKU.</td>\n1188:<td>The sizing strategy for us to use. The value should be one of <code>fillPrintArea</code>, <code>fitPrintArea</code> or <code>stretchToPrintArea</code>. More information can be found in our <a href=\"#order-object-image-resizing\" title=\"Image resizing\">image resizing section</a>.</td>\n1191:<td><code>recipientCost</code></td>\n1194:<td>The price you charged the recipient for these items. While not required, it&#39;s highly recommended if you have international orders as it aids shipping companies with customs issues.</td>\n1203:<td><code>assets</code></td>\n1204:<td>array of <a href=\"#order-object-asset\" title=\"Order asset object\">Assets</a></td>\n1206:<td>File assets for this order item, i.e. the image file(s).</td>\n1210:<p>An Asset is an image belonging to a product. Our products support zero, one or many images per item, and the item&#39;s <code>assets</code> array determines the location of each image on the product. For a full list of which assets a given product supports, use the product lookup endpoint.</p>\n1221:<td><code>printArea</code></td>\n1224:<td>Name of the assets print area. Default value is <code>default</code>. Examples of other print areas include <code>spine</code> (for photobooks) and  <code>lid</code> (for jigsaws).</td>\n1254:<td>Not required by default, but is required when creating orders containing products where additional page pricing is applied - for example: photobooks.</td>\n1304:<td><code>fillPrintArea</code></td>\n1309:<td><code>fitPrintArea</code></td>\n1314:<td><code>stretchToPrintArea</code></td>\n1321:Please note: only image assets (PNG, JPEG) can be resized. PDF files are processed exactly at the size they are received.\n1326:                <h2 id='create-order'>Create order</h2><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\"><span class=\"httpmethod\">POST</span><span>/v4.0/orders</span>\n1327:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/Orders\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1334:        \"shippingMethod\": \"Overnight\",\n1335:        \"recipient\": {\n1359:                \"sku\": \"GLOBAL-CFPM-16X20\",\n1361:                \"sizing\": \"fillPrintArea\",\n1365:                \"recipientCost\": {\n1369:                \"assets\": [\n1371:                        \"printArea\": \"default\",\n1398:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"shippingMethod\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Overnight\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1404:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"downloadAssets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"NotStarted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1405:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printReadyAssetsPrepared\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"NotStarted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1413:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipient\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n1441:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sku\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"GLOBAL-CFPM-16X20\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1443:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1447:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"assets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">\n1450:                        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"default\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1456:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipientCost\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n1475:<p>POSTing to the <code>/orders</code> endpoint submits and creates your order in Prodigi.</p>\n1479:<p>Where an order has been submitted and is paused only the order ID is returned in the initial response, with the order status being set to &quot;on hold&quot;. For orders in this state, you can continue to make updates to the order via the Prodigi dashboard. Once the pause window expires, a web-hook is triggered containing the full order details.</p>\n1481:<p>Please refer to the <a href=\"#order-actions\" title=\"Order actions\">Order actions</a> section on more information about updating existing orders. Once an order passes into fulfilment, it can no longer be changed or cancelled.</p>\n1514:                <h2 id='get-order-by-id'>Get order by ID</h2><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\"><span class=\"httpmethod\">GET</span><span>/v4.0/orders/{prodigi_order_id}</span>\n1515:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/orders/ord_677258\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1527:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"shippingMethod\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Overnight\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1533:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"downloadAssets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"NotStarted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1534:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printReadyAssetsPrepared\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"NotStarted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1542:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipient\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n1560:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sku\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"GLOBAL-CFPM-16X20\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1562:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1566:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"assets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">\n1569:                        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"default\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1576:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipientCost\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n1613:                <h2 id='get-orders'>Get orders</h2><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\"><span class=\"httpmethod\">GET</span><span>/v4.0/orders</span>\n1614:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/orders\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1618:<p>This endpoint returns a list of <a href=\"#order-object\">Orders</a> for the given filtering options.</p>\n1634:<td>Number of orders to return. Must be 1&ndash;100.</td>\n1640:<td>Number of records to skip before the next <code>top</code> worth of orders. Must be greater than or equal to 0.</td>\n1646:<td>Limit to orders placed after this date/time (UTC). Can be used without <code>createdTo</code>.</td>\n1652:<td>Limit to orders placed before this date/time (UTC). Can be used without <code>createdFrom</code>.</td>\n1673:<h3 id='get-orders-response'>Response</h3><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\">Response\n1676:    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"orders\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">\n1695:    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"nextUrl\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/Orders?Skip=10\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1707:<td><code>orders</code></td>\n1708:<td>array of <a href=\"#order-object\" title=\"Order object\">Orders</a></td>\n1719:<td>If <code>HasMore</code> is true, contains the full URL to the next page of orders.</td>\n1742:                <h2 id='get-actions'>Get actions</h2><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\"><span class=\"httpmethod\">GET</span><span>/v4.0/orders/{prodigi_order_id}/actions</span>\n1743:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/Orders/ord_123456/actions\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1752:    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"changeRecipientDetails\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n1755:    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"changeShippingMethod\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n1769:<li>Update recipient details</li>\n1773:<p>You can find out which actions are currently valid for a given order by sending a GET request to the order&#39;s <code>actions</code> endpoint: <code>Orders/{prodigi_order_id}/actions</code>.</p>\n1803:                <h2 id='cancel-an-order'>Cancel an order</h2><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\"><span class=\"httpmethod\">POST</span><span>/v4.0/orders/{prodigi_order_id}/actions/cancel</span>\n1804:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/orders/ord_123456/actions/cancel\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1816:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"shippingMethod\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Overnight\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1822:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"downloadAssets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"NotStarted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1823:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printReadyAssetsPrepared\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"NotStarted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1831:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipient\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n1849:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sku\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"GLOBAL-CFPM-16X20\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1851:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1855:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"assets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">\n1858:                        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"default\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1864:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipientCost\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n1930:<p>By default all orders submitted via the Print API will be submitted and sent to fulfilment immediately.</p>\n1932:<p>Through the <a href=\"https://dashboard.prodigi.com\">Prodigi dashboard</a> you can configure a pause window for all orders to adhere to, either by setting an amount of time for all orders to be paused, or you can configure orders to be paused indefinitely, requiring orders to then be submitted manually through the dashboard.</p>\n1936:                <h2 id='update-shipping-method'>Update shipping method</h2><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\"><span class=\"httpmethod\">POST</span><span>/v4.0/orders/{prodigi_order_id}/actions/updateShippingMethod</span>\n1937:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/Orders/ord_123456/actions/updateShippingMethod\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n1940:  <span class=\"nt\">-d</span> <span class=\"s1\">'{ \"shippingMethod\": \"Budget\" }'</span>\n1951:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"shippingMethod\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Express\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1957:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"downloadAssets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"NotStarted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1958:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printReadyAssetsPrepared\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"NotStarted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1966:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipient\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n1984:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sku\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"GLOBAL-CFPM-16X20\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1986:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1990:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"assets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">\n1993:                        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"default\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n1999:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipientCost\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n2109:                <h2 id='update-recipient'>Update recipient</h2><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\"><span class=\"httpmethod\">POST</span><span>/v4.0/orders/{prodigi_order_id}/actions/updateRecipient</span>\n2110:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/Orders/ord_123456/actions/updateRecipient\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n2132:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipient\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n2149:</span></code></pre></div></div><h3 id='update-recipient-request-parameters'>Request parameters</h3>\n2165:<td><code>recipient</code></td>\n2166:<td><a href=\"#update-recipient-recipient-object\" title=\"Recipient object\">Recipient</a></td>\n2168:<td>Amended recipient details.</td>\n2171:<h3 id='update-recipient-recipient-object'>Recipient object</h3>\n2184:<td>Full name of the recipient</td>\n2190:<td>Recipient&#39;s email</td>\n2196:<td>Recipient&#39;s primary contact number</td>\n2200:<td><a href=\"#update-recipient-recipient-address-object\">Address</a></td>\n2202:<td>Recipient&#39;s address</td>\n2205:<h3 id='update-recipient-recipient-address-object'>Recipient Address object</h3>\n2218:<td>First line of recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n2224:<td>Second line of recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n2230:<td>Town or city of recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n2236:<td>State or county of the recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n2242:<td>Postcode or zip code of recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n2248:<td>Two-letter ISO country code of recipient&#39;s address.</td>\n2251:<h3 id='update-recipient-response'>Response</h3>\n2260:<td>Returns an <a href=\"#update-recipient-update-recipient-response-object\" title=\"UpdateRecipientResponse object\">UpdateRecipientResponse</a> object.</td>\n2264:<td>Failed to update the recipient, most likely because of an invalid <code>prodigi_order_id</code>.</td>\n2267:<h3 id='update-recipient-updaterecipientresponse-object'>UpdateRecipientResponse object</h3>\n2291:<h3 id='update-recipient-shipmentdetail-object'>ShipmentDetail object</h3>\n2320:<h3 id='update-recipient-update-recipient-outcomes'>Update recipient outcomes</h3>\n2333:<td>Recipient updated in the order and all shipments.</td>\n2338:<td>Recipient updated in the order and some shipments, but at least one shipment could not be updated.</td>\n2352:                <h2 id='update-metadata'>Update metadata</h2><div class=\"codesection\"><div class=\"codeheader\"><span class=\"httpmethod\">POST</span><span>/v4.0/orders/{prodigi_order_id}/actions/updatemetadata</span>\n2353:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/Orders/ord_123456/actions/updateMetadata\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n2375:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"shippingMethod\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Express\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n2381:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"downloadAssets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"NotStarted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n2382:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printReadyAssetsPrepared\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"NotStarted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n2390:        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipient\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n2408:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sku\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"GLOBAL-CFPM-16X20\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n2410:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sizing\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"fillPrintArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n2414:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"assets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">\n2417:                        </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"default\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n2423:                </span><span class=\"nl\">\"recipientCost\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n2487:<p>The Quote endpoint allows you to get pricing and shipping information about a given set of products without creating an order. It returns how the order will be fulfilled, including:</p>\n2491:<li>The cost of the products</li>\n2534:                    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sku\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"GLOBAL-TECH-IP11P-FC-CP\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n2541:                    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"assets\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"w\">\n2543:                            </span><span class=\"nl\">\"printArea\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"default\"</span><span class=\"w\">\n2554:<p>Each Quote provides pricing information for products and shipments based on a specific <a href=\"#create-quote-top-level\">shipping method</a>.</p>\n2556:<p>If a <code>shippingMethod</code> is specified for a Quote, only that shipping method is returned. If a <code>shippingMethod</code> is not specified, a Quote for each of the shipping methods is returned: budget, standard, standard plus, express and overnight.</p>\n2702:<td><code>sku</code></td>\n2704:<td>Prodigi SKU of the product. Use the <a href=\"#product-details\" title=\"Product details endpoint\">Product Details</a> endpoint for full SKU information.</td>\n2719:<td>Product attributes, such as a frame colour. The <a href=\"#product-details\" title=\"Product details endpoint\">Product Details</a> endpoint returns a SKU&#39;s available attributes.</td>\n2722:<td><code>assets</code></td>\n2723:<td>array of <a href=\"#assets\" title=\"Order asset object\">Assets</a></td>\n2724:<td>Expected assets. Some additional assets may incur additional costs.</td>\n2769:</div><div class=\"highlight\"><pre class=\"highlight shell tab-shell\"><code>curl <span class=\"s2\">\"https://api.sandbox.prodigi.com/v4.0/quotes\"</span> <span class=\"se\">\\</span>\n2775:        \"shippingMethod\": \"Budget\",\n2780:                \"sku\": \"GLOBAL-CAN-10x10\",\n2783:                \"assets\" : [\n2784:                    { \"printArea\" : \"default\" }\n2788:                \"sku\": \"GLOBAL-FAP-10x10\",\n2791:                \"assets\" : [\n2792:                    { \"printArea\" : \"default\" }\n2796:                \"sku\": \"BOOK-FE-A4-P-HARD-G\",\n2799:                \"assets\" : [\n2800:                    { \"printArea\": \"default\", \"pageCount\": 100 }\n2861:                    </span><span class=\"nl\">\"sku\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"GLOBAL-CAN-10X10\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\">\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
