 stretch. Gildan Softstyle® is crafted from ring-spun cotton, giving it a smooth, lightweight feel that enhances comfort and printability.</p> <p>Cut with a semi-fitted silhouette, it features a crew neck, short sleeves and seamless design for freedom of movement. </p> <p>Each piece is custom printed using direct-to-garment technology, ensuring super-sharp detail and vibrant, long-lasting colour, before being packaged and shipped directly to your customer. </p> <p>This product also supports extra features, including removable tags and multiple print areas. These are available at an additional cost, with details on pricing and availability explained in our <a href=\"https://www.prodigi.com/faq/products/#what-are-costed-assets\" title=\"FAQs\">FAQs</a>.</p> <p><strong>Please note: Fibre content varies by colour. Please see below for more information.</strong></p> </div> <div class=\"product__features\"> <ul> <li>Made from 100% cotton</li> <li>Gildan Softstyle® </li> <li>Ring-spun</li> <li>Crew neck</li> <li>Short sleeves</li> <li>Seamless design</li> <li>Semi-fitted</li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"mt-8\"> Gildan 64000 t-shirts are part of our <a href=\"/products/unisex-apparel/\" title=\"Unisex apparel\">Unisex apparel</a> and <a href=\"/products/eco/\" title=\"Eco\">Eco</a> collections. </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"lg:w-3/5 pt-8 text-center\"> <ul class=\"product__gallery\"> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <img src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000/detail-02.webp\" alt=\"Detail 02\"/> </li> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <img src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000/detail-03.webp\" alt=\"Detail 03\"/> </li> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <img src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000/detail-01.webp\" alt=\"Detail 01\"/> </li> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <video controls autoplay loop muted> <source src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000/gildan64000-v9.webm\" type=\"video/webm\"> </video> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </sectio