. </p> <p>This product also supports extra features, including removable tags and multiple print areas. These are available at an additional cost, with details on pricing and availability explained in our <a href=\"https://www.prodigi.com/faq/products/#what-are-costed-assets\" title=\"FAQs\">FAQs</a>.</p> <p><strong>Please note: Fibre content varies by colour. Please see below for more information.</strong></p> </div> <div class=\"product__features\"> <ul> <li>Made from 100% cotton</li> <li>Gildan Softstyle® </li> <li>Ring-spun</li> <li>Crew neck</li> <li>Short sleeves</li> <li>Side seams</li> <li>Semi-fitted</li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"mt-8\"> Gildan 64000L t-shirts are part of our <a href=\"/products/eco/\" title=\"Eco\">Eco</a> collection. </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"lg:w-3/5 pt-8 text-center\"> <ul class=\"product__gallery\"> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <img src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000l/gildan-64000l-front_navy.webp\" alt=\"Gildan 64000l front_navy\"/> </li> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <img src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000l/gildan-64000l-back.webp\" alt=\"Gildan 64000l back\"/> </li> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <img src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000l/gildan-64000l-front_purple.webp\" alt=\"Gildan 64000l front_purple\"/> </li> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <img src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000l/gildan-64000l-front_lightblue.webp\" alt=\"Gildan 64000l front_lightblue\"/> </li> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <img src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000l/gildan-64000l-back_lightblue.webp\" alt=\"Gildan 64000l back_lightblue\"/> </li> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <video controls autoplay loop muted> <source src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000l/gildan64000-v9.webm\" type=\"video/webm\"> </video> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </section> <section id=\"product-range\" class=\"container\"> <div class=\" mt-16 pt-8 lg:mt-32 lg:pt-12 border-t\"> <h2 class=\" flex